Third-party archived reference artifacts:
- `four-colours/recon/rsst/` preserves the unmodified public Four-Colour Theorem
  proof files by N. Robertson, D. P. Sanders, P. D. Seymour, and R. Thomas (1997).
- `four-colours/sota_d/steinberger/` and `four-colours/sota_d/source.tar`
  preserve the public arXiv:0905.0043v3 ancillary files by J. P. Steinberger (2009/2010).
These third-party files remain subject to their respective authors' terms and attribution.
